    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"soften the echo\"... that's a nice way to put it. but it doesn't change the fact that he's gone. every time i walk into the kitchen or see his shoes by the door, it's like being hit by a wave. it's just constant. i feel like i'm just waiting for a pain that never ends. it feels more like a burden than a life at this point.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
